# deps.map: Debian package name -> Arch package name, hand curated.
# One pair per line. "-" means intentionally dropped on Arch (covered by the
# base system, an alternation we do not take, or deliberately not packaged).
# update.sh's drift check STOPS on any Depends/Recommends token in a new .deb
# that has no line here; add the mapping (and the PKGBUILD change it implies),
# then rerun.
